					<h2 class="t-section">{stats.totalCalls} real commands, replayed on the release binary</h2>
					<p class="lede">
						One developer's actual usage, not a fixture set chosen to flatter the result. {stats.bytesIn} in, {stats.bytesOut} out.
					</p>
					{/* The manual opens its own headline with this warning, so the page
					    that quotes the headline carries it too. Leaving it in the manual
